#LangSmith
LANGSMITH_API_KEY=Enter your LangSmith API key here
LANGSMITH_TRACING=Enter true or false to enable or disable LangSmith tracing
LANGSMITH_PROJECT=Enter your LangSmith project name here

#LLM Model 
NVIDIA_API_KEY=Enter your NVIDIA API key here

#OpenSearch 
OPENSEARCH_INITIAL_ADMIN_PASSWORD=Enter your OpenSearch initial admin password here

#Azure Blob Storage
AZURE_STORAGE_ACCOUNT_URL=Enter your Azure Storage account URL here
AZURE_STORAGE_CONTAINER_NAME=Enter your Azure Storage container name here
AZURE_TEST_BLOB_NAME=Enter your Azure test blob name here

#RDBMS
POSTGRES_DB=Enter your PostgreSQL database name here
POSTGRES_USER=Enter your PostgreSQL username here
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=Enter your PostgreSQL password here
POSTGRES_HOST=Enter your PostgreSQL host here
POSTGRES_PORT=Enter your PostgreSQL port here

#Azure 
AZURE_CREDENTIAL_MODE=Enter your Azure credential mode here (e.g., azure_cli, service_principal, etc.)